            <ArticleTitle>[Problems after surgery of acute abdomen].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>27-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many problems may persist after operation of an acute abdomen. Most important are peritonitis, hemorrhage, vascular occlusion and reduced general condition. Pathophysiology, clinical symptoms and therapeutic principles are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
